1
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,500
This is Polymorph:

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,176
a free 3D editor made for GTA V and FiveM creators.

3
00:00:10,216 --> 00:00:15,659
Model a prop, build an MLO interior, or edit the real map.

4
00:00:15,659 --> 00:00:19,975
Then export a FiveM resource, ready to ensure.

5
00:00:19,975 --> 00:00:21,852
All in one free app.

6
00:00:22,916 --> 00:00:25,424
Modelling feels familiar.

7
00:00:25,424 --> 00:00:30,339
A non-destructive modifier stack, precise vertex,

8
00:00:30,339 --> 00:00:35,756
edge and face snaps, clean booleans, and Wall Opening,

9
00:00:35,756 --> 00:00:39,368
to cut doors and windows in seconds.

10
00:00:40,416 --> 00:00:42,626
Texture it right there.

11
00:00:42,626 --> 00:00:48,294
GTA shaders, one-click UVs, sculpt brushes, and Molo Paint:

12
00:00:48,294 --> 00:00:52,617
layers, smart materials and procedural nodes,

13
00:00:52,617 --> 00:00:55,979
exported straight to game textures.

14
00:00:57,016 --> 00:01:02,526
Animate with keys and texture scroll, saved as a GTA animation.

15
00:01:02,526 --> 00:01:06,112
And place point, spot and capsule lights,

16
00:01:06,112 --> 00:01:08,211
with every game setting.

17
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:10,691
The MLO Room Builder.

18
00:01:10,691 --> 00:01:13,917
Draw the floor plan, and closed rooms, portals,

19
00:01:13,917 --> 00:01:16,251
doors and frames build themselves.

20
00:01:16,251 --> 00:01:19,339
A GTA checker fixes what would crash in game.

21
00:01:20,383 --> 00:01:23,255
MAP mode loads the whole GTA V map,

22
00:01:23,255 --> 00:01:26,948
with real models streaming around the camera.

23
00:01:26,948 --> 00:01:30,641
Move, delete and place props, edit interiors,

24
00:01:30,641 --> 00:01:32,857
and model right on the map.

25
00:01:33,916 --> 00:01:37,946
Weapon Forge and Vehicle Forge turn any model into a GTA

26
00:01:37,946 --> 00:01:39,530
weapon or a FiveM car.

27
00:01:39,530 --> 00:01:42,048
The meta files are written for you.

28
00:01:43,083 --> 00:01:45,543
Everything lives in the GTA panel.

29
00:01:45,543 --> 00:01:49,741
Press F10, and you get a FiveM resource with its manifest,

30
00:01:49,741 --> 00:01:51,694
ready for your test server.

31
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:55,175
Polymorph also talks to AI.

32
00:01:55,175 --> 00:01:58,320
With its Python API and MCP server,

33
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:01,555
your AI assistant can model for you.

34
00:02:01,555 --> 00:02:02,723
New in 1.7.7:

35
00:02:02,723 --> 00:02:07,126
turn a Marble world into a clean GTA room, by AI.

36
00:02:08,183 --> 00:02:11,617
Polymorph is free forever, for personal and commercial work.

37
00:02:11,617 --> 00:02:13,677
Download it, and join us on Discord.

38
00:02:13,677 --> 00:02:15,337
Links are in the description.

